{"id": "dev033", "question": "试验资料先别参与搜索，该怎么做；若只保留作存档，还能直接编辑吗？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact_single", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": null, "expected_route": "SINGLE", "gold_docs": ["self-host/use-dify/knowledge/manage-knowledge/maintain-knowledge-documents"], "nuggets": [{"text": "在文档列表禁用这些文档，可临时排除检索。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "归档后的文档为只读，不能直接编辑。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "novice", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "distant", "behavior_group": "single", "behavior_subtype": "synonym", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["self-host/use-dify/knowledge/manage-knowledge/maintain-knowledge-documents", "cloud/use-dify/knowledge/manage-knowledge/maintain-knowledge-documents"]], "reference_answer": "在文档列表禁用这些文档，可暂时排除检索。若改为归档保存，文档会变为只读，不能直接编辑；可以取消归档。", "most_likely_failure": "将禁用与归档混为一谈，或声称归档后仍可直接编辑。"}
{"id": "dev034", "question": "代码节点字符串默认最多多少字符，改上限用什么配置？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact_single", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": null, "expected_route": "SINGLE", "gold_docs": ["self-host/use-dify/nodes/code"], "nuggets": [{"text": "字符串输出默认最大长度为400,000个字符。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "字符串上限可由CODE_MAX_STRING_LENGTH配置调整。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "novice", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "single", "behavior_subtype": "numeric_table", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["self-host/use-dify/nodes/code", "self-host/deploy/configuration/environments"]], "reference_answer": "默认最多400,000个字符，通过API容器的CODE_MAX_STRING_LENGTH调整。", "most_likely_failure": "误答旧默认值、把字符数当token数或把沙箱超时当输出长度。", "all_equivalent_gold_docs": ["self-host/deploy/configuration/environments", "self-host/use-dify/nodes/code"]}
{"id": "dev035", "question": "Chatflow要跨轮记住访客偏好，该用什么节点保存，保留范围是什么？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact_single", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": null, "expected_route": "SINGLE", "gold_docs": ["self-host/use-dify/nodes/variable-assigner"], "nuggets": [{"text": "使用变量赋值器将偏好写入会话变量。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "会话变量在同一聊天会话的多个轮次间持续存在。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "novice", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "distant", "behavior_group": "single", "behavior_subtype": "neighbor", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["self-host/use-dify/nodes/variable-assigner"]], "reference_answer": "用变量赋值器写入会话变量，偏好可在同一聊天会话的多个轮次中保留；这不表示跨所有独立会话保存。", "most_likely_failure": "把分支汇聚当持久化状态写入，或声称能跨所有会话保存。"}
{"id": "dev036", "question": "MCP地址重生成后旧链还能用吗，为什么要保密？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact_single", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": null, "expected_route": "SINGLE", "gold_docs": ["self-host/use-dify/publish/publish-mcp"], "nuggets": [{"text": "重新生成MCP服务器URL后，旧URL立即失效。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "MCP服务器URL本身包含身份验证凭据，因此需要保密。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "novice", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "single", "behavior_subtype": "short", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["self-host/use-dify/publish/publish-mcp"]], "reference_answer": "旧URL会立即停止工作；MCP服务器URL本身包含身份验证凭据，因此应像API密钥一样保密。", "most_likely_failure": "把重新生成理解成新增一个仍与旧地址并存的入口。"}
{"id": "dev037", "question": "云版有哪些登录方式，同邮箱换一种登录会新建账户吗？", "split": "dev", "type": "version", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": "cloud", "expected_route": "SINGLE", "gold_docs": ["cloud/use-dify/workspace/personal-account-management"], "nuggets": [{"text": "云版支持GitHub、Google、邮箱验证码登录。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "邮箱相同的不同登录方式自动关联为同一账户。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "novice", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "single", "behavior_subtype": "single_version", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["cloud/use-dify/workspace/personal-account-management"]], "reference_answer": "可用GitHub、Google或邮箱验证码登录。不同登录方式使用同一邮箱时会自动关联为同一账户，不会因此另建一个账户。", "most_likely_failure": "用自部署邮箱密码或Enterprise单点登录来替代云版列出的登录方式。"}
{"id": "dev038", "question": "Dify邮件助理第6课先拆来信的是什么，失败诊断用哪些返回值？", "split": "dev", "type": "reasoning", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": null, "expected_route": "MULTI", "gold_docs": ["learn/tutorials/workflow-101/lesson-06", "self-host/use-dify/nodes/parameter-extractor"], "nuggets": [{"text": "先拆来信使用参数提取器。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "通过__is_success判断提取状态，失败为0。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "通过__reason读取提取失败的错误描述。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "novice", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "multi", "behavior_subtype": "chain", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["learn/tutorials/workflow-101/lesson-06"], ["self-host/use-dify/nodes/parameter-extractor"]], "reference_answer": "第6课先用参数提取器把来信中的问题整理出来。其内置返回值__is_success表示提取状态（失败为0、成功为1），__reason给出失败时的错误描述。", "most_likely_failure": "只复述课程中的question_list，遗漏该节点的内置失败诊断返回值。"}
{"id": "dev039", "question": "Dify邮件助理第5课接回两条回复的是什么，支持哪些数据类型？", "split": "dev", "type": "reasoning", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": null, "expected_route": "MULTI", "gold_docs": ["learn/tutorials/workflow-101/lesson-05", "self-host/use-dify/nodes/variable-aggregator"], "nuggets": [{"text": "将两条邮件回复接到同一出口的是变量聚合器。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "支持string、number、object、boolean、array、file六种类型。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "novice", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "multi", "behavior_subtype": "chain", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["learn/tutorials/workflow-101/lesson-05"], ["self-host/use-dify/nodes/variable-aggregator"]], "reference_answer": "第5课用变量聚合器接回互斥分支上的两条邮件回复。该节点支持string、number、object、boolean、array和file类型。", "most_likely_failure": "只答课程中的文本回复类型，未沿组件名查完整支持类型列表。"}
{"id": "dev040", "question": "应用密钥能跨应用用吗，限定库的密钥能调用无库ID的接口吗？", "split": "dev", "type": "reasoning", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": null, "expected_route": "MULTI", "gold_docs": ["api-reference/guides/get-started", "api-reference/guides/knowledge"], "nuggets": [{"text": "一个应用密钥仅作用于创建它的那个应用。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "限定范围的知识库密钥不能调用路径中没有dataset_id的接口。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "novice", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "multi", "behavior_subtype": "parallel_compare", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["api-reference/guides/get-started"], ["api-reference/guides/knowledge"]], "reference_answer": "应用密钥只作用于一个应用，不能跨应用通用。限定范围的知识库密钥只可调用路径带范围内dataset_id的接口；路径无dataset_id会返回403 forbidden。", "most_likely_failure": "混淆应用密钥与工作空间知识库密钥的访问范围。"}
{"id": "dev041", "question": "元数据支持什么值类型、字段名允许哪些字符、单篇删字段会删全库吗？", "split": "dev", "type": "summary", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": null, "expected_route": "MULTI", "gold_docs": ["self-host/use-dify/knowledge/metadata"], "nuggets": [{"text": "支持字符串、数字、时间三种值类型。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "元数据字段名允许的字符集合为小写字母、数字和下划线。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "单篇文档删字段只影响该文档，知识库字段仍保留。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "novice", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "multi", "behavior_subtype": "scattered_ordered", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["self-host/use-dify/knowledge/metadata", "cloud/use-dify/knowledge/metadata"]], "reference_answer": "支持字符串、数字、时间三种值类型。字段名只允许小写字母、数字和下划线，不支持空格与大写字母。单篇文档删除字段只删除该文档中的字段和值，知识库的全局字段仍保留。", "most_likely_failure": "允许字段名含大写或空格，或把单篇删除扩大为全库删除。"}
{"id": "dev042", "question": "教育优惠要求哪类邮箱、一次认证能用于几个空间、期满会自动续订吗？", "split": "dev", "type": "summary", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": "cloud", "expected_route": "MULTI", "gold_docs": ["cloud/use-dify/workspace/subscription-management"], "nuggets": [{"text": "需用学校颁发给当前在读学生或在职员工的邮箱。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "每次教育认证只能用于一个工作空间。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "教育订阅不会自动续订。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "novice", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "multi", "behavior_subtype": "scattered_ordered", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["cloud/use-dify/workspace/subscription-management"]], "reference_answer": "需要学校颁发给在读学生或在职员工的邮箱，个人邮箱和仅校友邮箱不符合新申请条件。一次认证仅可用于一个工作空间。教育订阅到期不会自动续订；要继续优惠须重新验证。", "most_likely_failure": "按账户给所有空间套优惠，或将教育版当成自动扣费续订。"}
