{"id": "dev044", "question": "聊天日志默认保留多久？", "split": "dev", "type": "unanswerable", "unanswerable_category": "underspecified", "edition": null, "expected_route": "CLARIFY", "gold_docs": ["cloud/use-dify/monitor/logs", "self-host/use-dify/monitor/logs"], "nuggets": [], "persona": "novice", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "clarify", "behavior_subtype": "version_unspecified", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["cloud/use-dify/monitor/logs"], ["self-host/use-dify/monitor/logs"]], "reference_answer": "需确认是Dify Cloud的哪个套餐，还是社区自部署。Sandbox保留30天；Professional/Team的对话日志在订阅有效期内持续保留；社区自部署默认无限期保留，可配置清理。可先反问版本和套餐，也可直接给这些带条件的答案。", "most_likely_failure": "把Sandbox的30天说成全产品默认值，或一概断言永久。"}
